# React Component Structure

<version>1.0.0</version>

## Context
- All React component files

## Requirements
- Use functional components only
- Use React hooks for state and lifecycle
- Export components as default or named exports
- Place reusable UI in `src/components/ui/`

## Examples
<example>
export default function Button({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) { return <button>{children}</button> }
</example>
<example type="invalid">
class Button extends React.Component { render() { return <button>{this.props.children}</button> } }
</example>
